    {
      "id": "notes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 18,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 18,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "FSDP behavior:\n• Each param leaf with shape [..., D, ...] where D % 4 == 0 → shard along D\n• Non-divisible leaves → replicate on every GPU\n• Scalars (step, lr_mult, data_position) → always replicated\n• Per-step comm: reduce-scatter grads + all-gather params (1B model: ~16 GB traffic)\n• NVLink-5 mesh: ~9 ms per step for collectives\n• with_sharding_constraint forces reduce-scatter (not all-reduce — saves 8x bandwidth)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FSDP behavior:\n• Each param leaf with shape [..., D, ...] where D % 4 == 0 → shard along D\n• Non-divisible leaves → replicate on every GPU\n• Scalars (step, lr_mult, data_position) → always replicated\n• Per-step comm: reduce-scatter grads + all-gather params (1B model: ~16 GB traffic)\n• NVLink-5 mesh: ~9 ms per step for collectives\n• with_sharding_constraint forces reduce-scatter (not all-reduce — saves 8x bandwidth)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 16
    }
  ],
